We give the complete Bott-Chern-Aeppli cohomology for compact complex 3-folds  in terms of Dolbeault, Frolicher, a bi-degree DeRham-like type of cohomology, $K^{p,q}$, defined  as 
$$ K^{p,q}=\frac{ker( \partial ) \cap ker( {\bar{\partial}}) }{im( \partial )\cap ker( {\bar{\partial}} )+im( {\bar{\partial}})\cap ker( \partial )}$$ and ${\check{H}}^1({\mathcal{PH}})$.

